{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>YHWH our Elohim, You answered them</b> — Moses and Aaron, when they fell on their faces, and the matter of the incense was for them a remedy, for on their account You bore [forgiveness] for Israel." "<b>And an avenger of their deeds</b> — in the matter of those burned and those swallowed."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 99, :notes {0 "Resolved ודבר הקטרת היית להם as 'the matter of the incense was for them a remedy'; reading היית as an Aramaic/late Hebrew form meaning 'was for them' with theological sense of intercession."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:37.533930002Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}